
### List all content categories
GET http://localhost:8000/{{settings.API_V1_STR}}/content/categories

### Get details of a specific content category
GET http://localhost:8000/{{settings.API_V1_STR}}/content/categories/{{category_name}}

### List all images in a category
GET http://localhost:8000/{{settings.API_V1_STR}}/content/categories/{{category_name}}/images

### List voices for a category
GET http://localhost:8000/{{settings.API_V1_STR}}/content/categories/{{category_name}}/voices


### List all items in a category
GET http://localhost:8000/{{settings.API_V1_STR}}/content/categories/{{category_name}}/items

### Get a single item by ID
GET http://localhost:8000/{{settings.API_V1_STR}}/content/categories/{{category_name}}/items/{{item_id}}

### List image variants for an item
GET http://localhost:8000/{{settings.API_V1_STR}}/content/categories/{{category_name}}/items/{{item_id}}/images

### List voices for an item
GET http://localhost:8000/{{settings.API_V1_STR}}/content/categories/{{category_name}}/items/{{item_id}}/voices
